          "from": "יָד /jaːd/ 'hand'",
          "to": "[jaːð]",
          "note": "Begedkefat spirantization: post-vocalic /d/ → [ð]. Hebrew dālet thus had a stop and a spirant realization."
        },
        {
          "from": "גָּדוֹל 'great', intervocalic dalet /d/",
          "to": "Tiberian [ɡɔːˈðoː.ol]"
